WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Rank shows where to look. Rank Symbols compresses a declared universe into a short inspection queue for the selected session.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Relative is not absolute. A first-place row can move because peers changed; preserve the denominator and the comparison set.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Read the fields behind the row. Open the scope, freshness, flow lens, and coverage before treating a rank difference as useful evidence.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:04:00.000
Promote a candidate to inspection. A candidate earns a drawer review only after the universe and session rules remain intact.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:05:00.000
Ask what could invert the rank. Missing rows, stale context, denominator drift, or a different lens can change relative attention.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:06:00.000
Keep rank descriptive. Rank does not assert direction, dealer intent, probability, or a trade decision.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:07:00.000
Record the inspection handoff. Save the rank view, selected row, scope, timestamp, and next check so another analyst can replay it.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:08:00.000
Open the symbol drawer. Next: S4E04 · open one symbol drawer and check freshness before reading the fields inside.
